WEBVTT

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.100
This is bad.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:10.220
Soulburner's LP are down to 600.

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:16.460
And all his monsters are destroyed, while 
Windy has Bahamut Bomber on his field.

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:20.980
They'll have to use their spell 
and trap cards carefully.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:24.700
But I believe they can find a way.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.870
Takeru, don't lose!

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:32.080
My turn!  I draw!

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:36.400
I activate the spell card, 
Salamangreat Performance!

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.020
When I have fewer LP than you...

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:44.050
...from my deck, I can get a 
copy of a Level 4 or lower

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:45.990
Salamangreat that's in my graveyard.

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:48.460
I select Fowl!

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:51.460
I activate Mole's effect from my graveyard!

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:55.400
When there are no monsters on 
my field, I banish this card.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.400
I return five Salamangreats 
in my graveyard to my deck.

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.740
Then I draw two cards!

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:04.870
I activate the Equip Spell, Rising Fire!

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:07.370
When there are no monsters on my field...

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:12.310
...I Special Summon a Fire monster from 
the graveyard and equip it with this card!

00:01:12.310 --> 00:01:15.150
Resurrect, Heatleo!

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:18.160
I equip it with Rising Fire!

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:25.100
The Field Spell, Stormrider Blast's effect!

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:29.220
When there's only one Stormrider 
Link Monster on the field...

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:34.840
...your Link Monster with equal or lower 
Link Markers has their effects negated.

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:38.310
Your Heatleo's effects are negated!

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:45.580
He resurrected Heatleo, but 
its effects are negated.

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:49.150
And it has lower ATK than Bahamut Bomber.

00:01:49.150 --> 00:01:52.160
Rising Fire raised its ATK.

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:55.390
But it can be destroyed due 
to Bahamut Bomber's effect.

00:01:55.390 --> 00:01:59.500
I activate the Equip Spell, 
Salamangreat Sparks!

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:03.860
During battle damage calculation, 
the equipped monster's ATK

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:06.870
become the same as your monster's!

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:11.450
And if this equipped card is destroyed 
and sent to the graveyard...

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:14.880
...I Special Summon up to 
two Salamangreat Tokens

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:17.850
on either of our fields in defense position!

00:02:18.710 --> 00:02:20.850
You're going for mutual destruction.

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:25.490
But Bahamut Bomber's effect will 
just destroy that Equip Card.

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:27.320
Are you sure?

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:31.460
I equip Sparks on Bahamut Bomber!

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:32.430
What?

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:37.050
Equip it on his opponent's monster?

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:38.550
Well done.

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:42.820
If Sparks is destroyed, Tokens 
will appear on Windy's field.

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:45.380
And he can't use Blast's effect.

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:48.480
I'm not done!

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:51.980
I activate the Equip 
Spell, Salamangreat Claw!

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:54.690
I equip it on Heatleo!

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:58.960
The equipped monster can't be 
destroyed in battle or by effects!

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:02.980
Now it won't be mutual destruction.

00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:05.400
Only Bahamut Bomber will be destroyed.

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:08.400
That makes it the annoying card!

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:10.540
Bahamut Bomber's effect!

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:17.170
I destroy one card in your Spell & 
Trap Zone and deal you 500 damage!

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:19.980
Vanish, Salamangreat Claw!

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:47.290
Our lives aren't forever

00:03:48.090 --> 00:03:54.080
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:03:55.030 --> 00:04:01.400
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:07.970
Sharing hope for the future

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:14.720
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:21.950
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:28.660
I want to share your pain

00:04:57.120 --> 00:05:03.380
You can still go for mutual destruction, but 
it'll be bad to lose Heatleo with only 100 LP.

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:07.200
I was waiting for Bahamut Bomber's effect!

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:10.760
I summon Salamangreat Falco!

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:21.410
When a non-Fowl Salamangreat is summoned, 
its effect Special Summons itself!

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:25.660
Appear!  The circuit that changes the future!

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:30.080
The summoning condition is 
one Level 4 or lower Cyberse!

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:32.680
Link Summon!

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:35.220
Link 1 Balelynx!

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:41.490
Due to Stormrider Blast's effect, 
its effects are negated!

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:48.890
By going to the graveyard, 
Falco's effect activates!

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:51.440
I set Claw from my graveyard!

00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:57.070
Appear again!  The circuit 
that changes the future!

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:02.470
The summoning conditions are 
two Fire Effect Monsters!

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:03.940
Link Summon!

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:10.080
Appear, Link 2 Salamangreat Sunlight Wolf!

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:13.550
Stormrider Blast's effect!

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:17.880
I'm not done!

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:22.460
The Field Spell, Salamangreat 
Sanctuary's effect!

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:26.800
Heatleo can use itself to Link Summon!

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:29.800
Reincarnation Link Summon!

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:34.770
Link 3 Salamangreat Heatleo!

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:38.910
The Field Spell, Stormrider Blast!

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.250
That's pointless!

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:44.720
I equip Salamangreat Claw on Heatleo!

00:06:45.230 --> 00:06:49.170
When Claw is equipped on a Reincarnation 
Link Summoned monster...

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:53.590
...it can attack for every Link 
Marker it has in a single battle!

00:06:53.590 --> 00:06:56.430
Heatleo has three Link Markers!

00:06:56.430 --> 00:07:02.930
Heatleo can't be destroyed in battle or 
by effects, and it can attack three times!

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:04.830
Th-Three times?

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:08.770
But Bahamut Bomber still has higher ATK!

00:07:08.770 --> 00:07:10.680
Did you forget?

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:14.220
Due to Sparks equipped on Bahamut Bomber...

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:17.440
...the equipped monster's 
ATK become the same

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:20.520
as the opponent's monster's 
ATK during battle.

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:23.490
D-Don't do it!

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:25.850
Here I go!  Battle!

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:28.730
Heatleo attacks Bahamut Bomber!

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:39.900
Since Bahamut Bomber is 
destroyed, Sparks is destroyed!

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:41.870
No!

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:44.110
Sparks's effect!

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:47.880
When it's destroyed and 
sent to the graveyard...

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:51.100
...two Salamangreat Tokens 
are Special Summoned

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:53.420
on your field in defense position!

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:58.990
Salamangreat Claw's additional effect 
lets me deal piercing damage!

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:01.990
If he attacks a Token...

00:08:01.990 --> 00:08:04.730
And he can attack twice more!

00:08:04.730 --> 00:08:06.460
Battle again!

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:10.940
This is bad!  Stop it!

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:13.170
Stop being pathetic, Windy!

00:08:13.170 --> 00:08:16.650
Heatleo attacks Token!

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:27.100
All right!  The next attack will end it!

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:30.140
This is the end!

00:08:30.140 --> 00:08:32.690
Heatleo attacks Token!

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.410
Just kidding.

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:44.120
I activate Stormrider Gulldiver's 
effect from my hand.

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:48.470
When I take battle damage, by 
sending this to the graveyard...

00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:52.940
...the damage is halved, and 
this turn's battle ends!

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:54.180
What?

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:02.390
Too bad!  I survived!

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:05.490
This is bad.

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:09.170
Why?  He now has lower than 1000 LP-

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:12.830
1000?  Can he use a Skill?

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:15.830
You just realized that?

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:21.560
I can use my Skill even during a Master Duel!

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:25.310
You were so eager to attack 
me that it backfired.

00:09:28.090 --> 00:09:32.210
My excellent acting tricked you, 
so you tried to win quickly.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:35.490
You're the ones who lost their cool.

00:09:36.980 --> 00:09:41.960
This is why he didn't use Gulldiver's 
effect on the first attack.

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:45.850
I banish Gulldiver from my 
graveyard to activate its effect!

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:48.240
I can Special Summon Bahamut Bomber

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:52.750
from my graveyard by halving its 
ATK and negating its effects!

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:56.240
Blast's effect!

00:09:56.580 --> 00:09:59.820
Stormrider gains 400 ATK.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:06.710
And gains 300 more for every Stormrider 
Field Spell in the graveyard.

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:08.090
Soulburner!

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:09.200
I know!

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:13.460
I activate the spell card, 
Salamangreat Sublimation!

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:19.580
I tribute Sunlight Wolf to 
regain LP equal to its ATK!

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:23.170
Then I draw one card from my deck!

00:10:24.090 --> 00:10:25.790
I'll set this!

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:26.650
Wait.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:31.020
Bahamut Bomber's effects may be negated.

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:35.150
But Windy must have countermeasures 
against set cards.

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:37.380
We should proceed cautiously.

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:39.350
But I'll still set this!

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:42.090
Calm down, Soulburner!

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:48.530
Do whatever you like.

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:51.900
I set a card and end my turn!

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:55.840
You actually set it!

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:58.870
Flame, he ignored your warning!

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:02.370
That's why I told you 
partners are a nuisance!

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:09.280
Here I go.

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:11.250
My turn.  I draw.

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:15.000
I return the banished 
Stolastorm to the field.

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:22.660
Due to Stormrider Blast's effect, 
Stolastorm gains a total of 700 ATK.

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:26.130
It's getting exciting!

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:33.840
When I have 1000 or lower LP, 
I add a random Link Monster

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:36.810
in the Data Storm to my Extra Deck!

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:38.780
I activate my Skill!

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:41.790
Storm Access!

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:47.690
A Skill during a Master 
Duel?  That's cheating!

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:50.800
Thanks for the praise!

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:55.280
Appear!  The circuit that rages before me!

00:11:56.060 --> 00:12:00.490
The summoning conditions are at 
least two Stormrider Link Monsters.

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:05.570
I set Stolastorm and Link 3 Bahamut 
Bomber in the Link Markers!

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:08.540
He's using Bahamut Bomber to Link Summon?

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.510
Link Summon!

00:12:10.510 --> 00:12:18.950
Appear, Link 4 Stormriderflagship 
Bahamut Bomber Custom!

00:12:18.950 --> 00:12:22.900
Stormrider Blast's effect gives it ATK!

00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:26.920
3700 ATK!

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:30.770
A new Bahamut Bomber?

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:36.370
Bahamut Bomber Custom's effect activates!

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:40.480
When there are no cards 
in my Spell & Trap Zone...

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:44.380
...I treat one of your monsters as a 
Continuous Spell

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:48.110
and place it in your Spell & Trap Zone!

00:12:48.110 --> 00:12:49.080
What?

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:53.320
Now Salamangreat Claw is destroyed.

00:12:55.890 --> 00:12:58.890
Bomber Custom's additional effect!

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:02.140
When there are no cards 
in my Spell & Trap Zone...

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:05.840
...all cards in your Spell 
& Trap Zone are destroyed,

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:08.870
and you take 500 damage per card!

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:13.600
When this effect activates, 
you can't activate effects.

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:19.630
Bye bye, Heatleo!

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:22.710
And bye bye to that annoying set card!

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:32.670
All cleaned up!

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:36.260
The set card was destroyed, as expected.

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:37.500
Yeah.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:43.500
If you listened to Flame, you would've 
avoided taking excess damage.

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:45.120
Understand?

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:48.740
Ignis are superior to humans!

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:54.210
But I can't say Ignis that 
side with humans are superior.

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:57.580
He even dissed me!

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:59.050
Battle!

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:01.120
This is the end!

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:04.660
Bahamut Bomber Custom attacks you directly!

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:12.630
I did say the wind would blow out your fire.

00:14:12.630 --> 00:14:14.360
Are you sure?

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:17.320
I'll use a trap!

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:20.840
A trap?  Where is it?

00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:24.710
You were so eager to win 
that you lost your cool.

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.180
What?

00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:29.620
It's the card you just sent to the graveyard!

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:36.210
I banish the trap card, Salamangreat Ascetic 
from the graveyard to activate its effect!

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:41.600
I return a Salamangreat Link Monster 
in the graveyard to the Extra Deck.

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:46.580
I Special Summon a Salamangreat in defense 
position by negating its effects!

00:14:46.580 --> 00:14:48.100
Come, Falco!

00:14:52.110 --> 00:14:54.090
Just give up!

00:14:54.090 --> 00:14:56.670
Bomber Custom attacks Falco!

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:58.350
Perish!

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:03.110
Balelynx's effect from the graveyard!

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:09.480
When a battle or effect will destroy 
Salamangreat, I can banish this card instead!

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:17.930
We expected you to destroy Ascetic, so 
we were able to activate its effect.

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:21.730
You knew I'd destroy it?

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:24.040
I end my turn!

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:27.640
You couldn't blow out our fire!

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:31.200
I still have Bomber Custom.

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:37.740
As long as I have Stormrider Blast's 
effect, you must attack Bomber Custom.

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:41.620
Your next turn is still your last!

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:44.620
It's true that we're in a bad situation.

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:46.860
I have to bet on my next draw.

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:50.900
That's a lot of responsibility, Mr. Partner!

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:55.930
Flame's fate rests on that draw.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:59.540
I believe in our future.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.580
Our future...

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:04.340
Yes.  Ours.

00:16:04.340 --> 00:16:06.430
That's right, partner!

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:09.010
Let's bet everything on this draw!

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:11.080
I can't use my Skill, but...

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:12.820
My turn!

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:17.250
I feel like a Burning Draw!

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:21.060
All right!

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:24.630
I summon Salamangreat Gazelle!

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:29.600
Gazelle's effect activates!

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:31.440
When it's summoned,

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:35.240
I send a non-Gazelle Salamangreat 
in my deck to the graveyard!

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:39.110
I send Salamangreat Spinny!

00:16:39.110 --> 00:16:41.980
Spinny's effect activates!

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:45.270
When a non-Spinny Salamangreat 
is on the field,

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:48.220
I can Special Summon it from the graveyard!

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:56.460
C'mon!  They're nothing 
compared to Bomber Custom!

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:59.460
You won't be saying that later!

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:02.430
Here we go!  Our new stage!

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:06.670
I overlay Level 3 Gazelle and Spinny!

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:08.640
Xyz?

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:13.460
With these two monsters, I 
build the Overlay Network!

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:34.570
Xyz Summon!

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:41.040
The flaming wild horse that 
cuts through illusions!

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:47.380
Rank 3 Salamangreat Miragestallio!

00:17:48.470 --> 00:17:50.710
Miragestallio's effect activates!

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:53.690
By using one Overlay Unit,

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:57.960
I Special Summon a Salamangreat 
from my deck in defense position!

00:17:57.960 --> 00:18:00.720
Come, Beat Bison!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:06.540
Beat Bison's effect activates!

00:18:06.540 --> 00:18:10.080
Up to the number of faceup 
cards on your field...

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:14.210
...I can return Fire Link Monsters 
in the graveyard to the Extra Deck.

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:21.150
And negate the same number of cards on 
your field until the end of the turn!

00:18:21.150 --> 00:18:24.120
Return, two Heatleo!

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:31.590
Bahamut Bomber Custom and the Field Spell, 
Stormrider Blast's effects are negated!

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:38.800
Appear!  The circuit that changes the future!

00:18:39.370 --> 00:18:44.000
The summoning conditions are at 
least two Fire Effect Monsters!

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:45.470
Link Summon!

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:50.120
Appear, Link 3 Salamangreat Heatleo!

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:52.980
Miragestallio's effect activates!

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:57.880
When it's Xyz Summoned and used 
to Link Summon a Salamangreat...

00:18:57.880 --> 00:19:00.890
...I return one monster 
on the field to the hand!

00:19:01.420 --> 00:19:05.290
I select Bahamut Bomber Custom!

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:06.510
What?

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:12.720
I activate Stormrider Tubieloof's 
effect from my hand!

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:17.070
I send it to the graveyard 
to negate your effect!

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:23.030
I'm not done!  I can keep fighting!

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:26.910
No.  Your wind has already stopped blowing!

00:19:27.280 --> 00:19:30.110
Salamangreat Sanctuary's effect!

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:33.250
Reincarnation Link Summon!

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:40.320
Resurrect, the king of beasts!

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:43.360
Salamangreat Heatleo!

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:49.450
The Reincarnation Link Summoned 
Heatleo's effect activates!

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:54.980
Spinny in the graveyard and Bahamut 
Bomber Custom's ATK become the same!

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:57.710
Don't do it!

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:00.110
Flame Possession!

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:09.390
Damn!  Why is this happening?

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:12.390
You said wind blows out fires.

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:16.360
But fire can burn harder than wind!

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:19.920
Stop messing around!

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:21.070
Battle!

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:25.140
Heatleo attacks Bahamut Bomber Custom!

00:20:25.810 --> 00:20:28.040
Heat Soul!

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:52.560
Why did I lose?

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:57.540
Because you're only trying 
to satisfy yourself, Windy.

00:20:57.540 --> 00:21:00.270
Myself?

00:21:00.270 --> 00:21:05.520
In a partnership, we must know and 
respect each other to create a new path.

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:08.630
That gives us strength 
to overcome our limits.

00:21:08.630 --> 00:21:14.020
When you ended your partner, 
you no longer had that.

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:21.190
I only lost because I lost my cool!

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:23.030
Lightning!

00:21:23.360 --> 00:21:27.030
Lightning!

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:31.500
There's no cure for the foolish.

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:36.470
I'll hold on to your data.

00:21:36.470 --> 00:21:39.440
Don't do it!

00:21:39.840 --> 00:21:44.490
Flame, I won't forget this hate!

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:49.300
I'm cursing you!

00:21:51.900 --> 00:21:54.690
Curse...

00:21:58.660 --> 00:22:02.460
AIs don't have curses.

00:22:22.200 --> 00:22:23.700
Trapped in conventionality

00:22:23.700 --> 00:22:25.140
Even denials are obvious

00:22:25.140 --> 00:22:26.270
That There This Whichever

00:22:26.270 --> 00:22:28.160
Hey, isn't it true?

00:22:28.440 --> 00:22:29.770
Why is it before you wake up

00:22:29.770 --> 00:22:31.340
You build a wall, saying it's impossible

00:22:31.340 --> 00:22:32.510
No discussions, no ideals

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:39.550
Even together, it's not the same

00:22:39.850 --> 00:22:42.620
Break yourself through  go way

00:22:42.820 --> 00:22:45.760
Even if you lose your 
way, keep moving forward

00:22:46.090 --> 00:22:48.830
Our desires won't be stopped

00:22:54.200 --> 00:22:57.400
Let your emotions spill

00:22:57.670 --> 00:23:03.540
Keep rewriting  only glory

00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:08.950
If we're together

00:23:09.250 --> 00:23:12.350
We can seize it

00:23:35.340 --> 00:23:40.660
For the sake of the future, Bohman 
says to leave everything to him.

00:23:40.660 --> 00:23:47.970
Even if that's the best plan, that doesn't 
reflect the views of those who are alive today.

00:23:48.650 --> 00:23:53.060
Who knows which side is correct.

00:23:53.060 --> 00:23:56.810
No matter the reason, I can't forgive you!

00:23:56.810 --> 00:24:01.550
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Creator of the Next Generation

00:24:01.550 --> 00:24:03.880
Into the VRAINS!
